The API (names, argument order, `dst` parameters, memory layouts and conventions:
column-major Float32Array matrices, mat3 padded to 12 floats, perspective with a
[0, 1] depth range, lookAt as a view matrix) follows wgpu-matrix 3.x, which the
react-native-webgpu example app imports. The code in this directory is a minimal
re-implementation of the functions the ported demos call. wgpu-matrix's licence:

